k">Click Here</a> to download the unblocked offline version.</p>
			<p class=3D"sectionHeading" id=3D"part1-characters"><b><a href=3D"https:=
//g.deev.is/fnaw/explanation.html#part1-characters">Part 1:</a></b> The cha=
racters in FNAW</p>
			<p>
<span class=3D"tab"></span>There are only 5 characters in Five Nights at Wi=
nstons, their behaviors are analogous to Bonnie, Chica, Foxy, Freddy, and a=
 combinaion of Freddy and Golden Freddy
			</p>
			<p>
			<br>
<span class=3D"tab"></span>They are erasers with faces drawn on them and pa=
perclips as arms, it was a thing me and my 'friends' used to do back in mid=
dle school as a joke when I made this game so that's how I had the idea
			</p>
