			<h3 id=3D"character-weirdclimberdude"><span style=3D"font-size:larger;">=
<a href=3D"https://g.deev.is/fnaw/explanation.html#character-weirdclimberdu=
de">Weird Climber Dude:</a>=E2=80=82<span style=3D"font-weight:normal;font-=
size:0.8em;">(He/Him)</span></span></h3>
			<p>
			<a href=3D"https://g.deev.is/fnaw/expl_images/char_weirdclimberdude.jpg"=
 style=3D"float:right;margin:5px;" target=3D"_blank" class=3D"nolink">
				<img src=3D"https://g.deev.is/fnaw/expl_images/char_weirdclimberdude.jp=
