"float:right;margin:5px;" target=3D"_blank" class=3D"nolink">
				<img src=3D"https://g.deev.is/fnaw/expl_images/char_laxdude.jpg" alt=3D=
"Five Nights at Winston's Weird Climber Dude Character" loading=3D"lazy" wi=
