			</a>
<span class=3D"tab"></span><b>Introduced in <a href=3D"https://g.deev.is/fn=
aw/explanation.html#night-2">Night 2.</a></b> Can be seen on cameras <b><a =
href=3D"https://g.deev.is/fnaw/explanation.html#camera-a1">A1</a></b>, <b><=
a href=3D"https://g.deev.is/fnaw/explanation.html#camera-a2">A2</a></b>, an=
d <b><a href=3D"https://g.deev.is/fnaw/explanation.html#camera-a3">A3</a></=
b>.
			<br>
			<br>
<span class=3D"tab"></span>Behavior is similar to <b>Foxy</b> in Five Night=
s at Freddy's. He begins on camera <b><a href=3D"https://g.deev.is/fnaw/exp=
lanation.html#camera-a3">A3</a></b> in the window of the bathroom <span sty=
