			<p>
<span class=3D"tab"></span><b>You play as the janitor of my middle school i=
n this game</b>. Me and my 'friends' used to think it was funny to mess wit=
h him back when I went to this school but also the janitor's office is the =
only logical place I could think of as the location for the player, it's sm=
all and messy and there is a door on either side in the real life version s=
o it was easy to base the game around.
			</p>
			<p>
<span class=3D"tab"></span>Here's a random recording of the guy I made acci=
dentally in September 2021 when I was messing with radios, I saw a distant =
line on the spectrum analyzer at ~150 MHz and tuned to it and heard this:
			</p>
