m that's on camera <b><a href=3D"https://g.deev.is/fnaw/explanation.html#ca=
mera-d6">D6</a></b>, apparently the administrators like to call him Larry.
			</p>
			<p>
<span class=3D"tab"></span>It's not very well labeled but here is the offic=
